OL,3,AZelensky says Ukraine has right to
OL,4,Adefend itself after Trump criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky has said
OL,7,Fhe is "only standing up for Ukraine's
OL,8,Finterests" after scathing criticism
OL,9,Ffrom Donald Trump, who said he was
OL,10,F"more difficult to deal with than
OL,11,F[Russian President Vladimir] Putin".
OL,13,FThe US president, who recently made a
OL,14,Fcontroversial deal with Moscow to
OL,15,Fimport diesel, said Kyiv's new wave of
OL,16,Fstrikes on Russian oil refineries was a
OL,17,F"disgrace".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
