OL,3,AZelensky says Ukraine has right to
OL,4,Adefend itself after Trump criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FZelensky said he could not accept the
OL,7,Fdiesel deal because it might be
OL,8,Ffollowed by a gas agreement. "If I
OL,9,Fdon't stand up to this... who else will
OL,10,Fdo this?" he said at an EU summit in
OL,11,FBrussels.
OL,13,FTensions between Washington and Kyiv
OL,14,Fescalated over the diesel deal and
OL,15,Fcurbs on Ukraine's battlefield
OL,16,Fsatellite network.
